 The Android client of **BaiduNetGo**, the Baidu Netdisk app whose desktop half is the
 Go/MyGo app at the repository root. It is a separate Gradle project: it does not
 build with `go build`, does not load the Go code, and can be built and released on its
-own. The user-facing design is Material 3 (Compose), with dynamic color, light/dark
-themes and a Chinese interface.
+own. The user-facing design is **Material 3 Expressive** (Compose):
+`MaterialExpressiveTheme` with `MotionScheme.expressive()`, rounded tonal cards on
+`surfaceBright`, expressive switches and segmented controls, large-radius dialogs,
+a floating tonal navigation bar, dynamic color on Android 12+, light/dark themes and
+a Chinese interface. The visual language follows the Material mode of
+[KernelSU](https://github.com/tiann/KernelSU) (`MaterialExpressiveTheme` +
+`TonalCard` + floating bottom bar); its Miuix and liquid-glass variants are not used.
 
 ## What it does
 
