+/*
+ * This file follows KernelSU's Material (Material 3 Expressive) component
+ * language (manager/app/src/main/java/me/weishu/kernelsu/ui/component/material):
+ * `surfaceBright` tonal cards with `shapes.large`, segmented rows with 2 dp gaps
+ * and 16 dp outer / 4 dp inner corners, expressive switches with thumb icons,
+ * pill-shaped segmented controls, extra-large dialog corners and springy motion.
+ * The segmented list primitives are re-implemented here because Material 3
+ * 1.4.0 (our pinned version) does not ship `SegmentedListItem`.
+ */
+
