index 1cdf29b..9ede160 100644
--- a/android/screenshots/README.md
+++ b/android/screenshots/README.md
@@ -4,11 +4,19 @@ Rendered PNGs of the app's real Compose screens, produced headlessly with
 Robolectric + Compose UI test (there is no emulator on this machine).
 
 Each image is 822 x 1782 px: the 411 x 891 dp Pixel-class phone layout at
-xhdpi. They are captured from `BaiduNetGoApp` (large top app bar + bottom
-`NavigationBar` + screen) and `SignInScreen` exactly as `MainActivity` shows
-them; only the state is sample data (`AppUiState` built in the test, modelled on
-`AppUiSamples` but with folders, albums, a running backup, last results and
-transfer history).
+xhdpi. They are captured from `BaiduNetGoApp` (large top app bar + floating
+expressive navigation pill + screen) and `SignInScreen` exactly as
+`MainActivity` shows them; only the state is sample data (`AppUiState` built in
+the test, modelled on `AppUiSamples` but with folders, albums, a running
+backup, last results and transfer history).
+
+The UI follows KernelSU's Material 3 Expressive language (`android/` app, not
+its Miuix mode): `surfaceBright` tonal cards with large corner radii, segmented
+settings rows 2 dp apart, expressive switches with ✓/✕ thumbs, pill-shaped
+segmented controls, extra-large dialog corners and a floating tonal navigation
+pill. `MaterialExpressiveTheme` + `MotionScheme.expressive()` drive motion.
+The Robolectric run leaves each screen at its resting state, so spring
+animations appear as their settled values.
 
